# Titan TV Man Upgraded

A Unity 3D Titan character prototype built with C#.

## Features

- Giant Titan TV Man character
- Three combat speakers
- Two auxiliary plasma screens
- Black smoke teleportation
- Melee and area attacks
- Ultimate energy explosion
- Health and damage systems
- Configurable attack cooldowns

## Controls

| Key | Action |
|---|---|
| W A S D | Move |
| Q / E | Rotate |
| J | Punch |
| K | Triple Speaker Shockwave |
| L | Dual Plasma Attack |
| F | Black Smoke Teleport |
| R | Ultimate Attack |

## Installation

1. Install Unity Hub.
2. Create or open a Unity 3D project.
3. Copy the scripts into Assets/Scripts/.
4. Add a CharacterController to the Titan.
5. Attach TitanTVMan, TitanCombat and
   BlackSmokePortal to the Titan GameObject.
6. Create and assign the speaker and screen transforms.
7. Assign optional particle effect prefabs.
8. Add EnemyHealth to enemy GameObjects.
9. Press Play to test.

## Requirements

- Unity 3D
- C#
- A compatible Unity Input Manager configuration

